Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.61,0:00:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.53,0:00:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sunk into the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.05,0:00:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all be alright as long as\Nwe don't move and don't make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's much too late to try\Nhiding from me at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know where each of you landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four, no five steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.87,0:00:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're walking quietly to avoid detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't hide from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.03,0:01:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears these steps\Nhave thrown him for a lube.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.65,0:01:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, you accursed water stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.11,0:01:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the moment you reveal yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll vaporize you with the\Npower of my magician's red.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.50,0:01:29.33,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.49,0:01:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The, the, my, and, and, e
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.35,0:01:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.07,0:02:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.95,0:02:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last page on the last page?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll grab that axe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.84,0:02:59.67,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,930)\pos(175,690)\fscx84.5}Episode 26: Iggy the Fool and Geb's N'Doul, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.87,0:02:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.17,0:03:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.45,0:03:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only moved five steps forward
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.25,0:03:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange, why's he\Nsuddenly stopped moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magicians run
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.53,0:03:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he be so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Avdol!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to admit, that plan was\Nactually a stroke of brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to pay more attention to\Ntheir vibrations from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.03,0:03:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those weren't footsteps at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.07,0:03:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would seem as though he\Nthrew some kind of metal rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.91,0:03:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And judging by these burns,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say Avdol did the deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But c 'est la vie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Avdol.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.95,0:04:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone started running.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.19,0:04:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know we can't just run around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.41,0:04:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stride says he's about\N190, no, 195 centimeters tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a youthfulness in his\Nstride, so he's not Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.93,0:04:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be Jotaro then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where exactly is he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It dove in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.43,0:04:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's going after Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.95,0:04:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful he's not\Nattacking Avdol anymore, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's catching up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.21,0:04:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear Jotaro's Star Platinum is\Nthe fiercest of the enemy's stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Dio will be beside himself with\Njoy if I take care of him here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:05:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the name of Master Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use every fiber of my being\Nto finally vanquish Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I heard correctly, Jotaro just\Npicked something up off the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what was at that location?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:23.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I remember. The dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro grabbed the dog,\Nwhich means he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.43,0:05:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally figured you out, mutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.45,0:05:31.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you jumped out of the car\Nbefore the stand attacked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.89,0:05:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can smell it, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.55,0:05:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know where it's going\Nto be before it gets there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.35,0:05:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop moving, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Iggy, I think it's time\Nfor you to earn your keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.51,0:05:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the stand coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.15,0:05:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just show me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me or we die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.61,0:05:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how would you get your gum then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.29,0:06:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higgy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can fly too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and pan all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting out of this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinums as fast as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.63,0:06:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're thinking of dropping me, I'll\Nsnap your neck before you can blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he jumped and\Nsuddenly disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.23,0:06:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.03,0:06:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have landed somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.03,0:06:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.99,0:06:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't move around so\Nto bypass that handicap,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's using Iggy to\Nfind the stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.77,0:06:51.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find whoever's\Ncontrolling the stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we might actually have a\Nchance of defeating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.43,0:06:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.57,0:06:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear Jotaro's footsteps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.37,0:07:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I hear his footsteps?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.61,0:07:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they're flying lower and lower!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.47,0:07:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't gonna end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the fool\Ncan't travel long distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:16.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The damn thing is gliding\Nlike a paper airplane!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My legs are about to touch the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mutt, quit tensing up like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.31,0:07:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're starting to fart again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For your sake, you better\Nnot let out a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.37,0:07:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get more air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at this point, there's\Nonly one way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kick got us a lot closer\Nto our destination, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the sound of it definitely\Ngave away our strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.95,0:07:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the user will know that\Nwe're flying to avoid detection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's why I wasn't\Nable to locate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog Stan has the ability to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I know what they're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're headed directly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to eliminate Jotaro\Nbefore he gets any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stands on the move and\Nit's going after Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He figured it out when Jotaro kicked off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing we can\Ndo now is trust Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.17,0:08:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.85,0:08:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know he was able to\Nbring down a helicopter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he shouldn't be able\Nto find our exact location,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since Iggy's stand barely makes a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to get to the stand user\Nbefore landing, and it'll be lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.71,0:08:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand user's about 400 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from the looks of\Nthings our enemy is blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.47,0:09:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, sand's falling from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.97,0:09:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course the stand user\Nmust be trying to find
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us he's using the sand\Nbouncing off the wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a submarine uses sonar because
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the falling sand i can hear you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.87,0:09:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've discovered your\Nexact location, Jotaro!
