Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.79,0:09:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.81,0:09:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum's speed won't\Nbe of much use, I'm afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't tell where my attack is coming\Nfrom, then my stand has the advantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.93,0:09:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes another!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.43,0:10:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You damn mutt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dragging Jotaro right into my trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.07,0:10:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like he'll do\Nanything to save his own hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even abandon his master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.35,0:10:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for relying\Non such a fickle creature, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.25,0:10:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your end has come, and now it's finally\Ntime to put you out of your misery.
