Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels like he just\Nthrew something at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:10:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't make out what it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is at that speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tossed Iggy at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.25,0:11:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better use your stand\Nto defend yourselves or else
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.09,0:11:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you two are going to be closer\Nthan you ever wanted to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.05,0:11:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such insane
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.91,0:11:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Velocity damn it it's going to hit me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he actually threw the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:31.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dog blasted I was so close to putting\Nan end to that wretch once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.53,0:11:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No I was so busy worrying about that damn\Ndog I completely lost Jodoro's location
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.33,0:11:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he vanished, and\Nhe's staying absolutely still.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been his plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.79,0:11:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't hide forever
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.43,0:12:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show yourself, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.83,0:12:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize you'd slink so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't had the foresight to\Nprotect myself with this water shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you would have already\Nknocked me out from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.05,0:12:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should count myself lucky\Nit makes for such a good defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given that we're now in\Nsuch close proximity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.47,0:12:40.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I no longer need this cane to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I will require\Nits use when I return home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.37,0:13:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe, but you\Nactually managed to knock off my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can relax a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.83,0:13:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell would you\Nuse your stand to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.55,0:14:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:01.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.03,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you thought you could...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.77,0:14:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thought you could manipulate\Nme and force me to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you information regarding\Nthe other eight Stand users,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.65,0:14:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.55,0:14:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm very well aware that Joseph Joestar's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.47,0:14:21.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple can view\Ninto the minds of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never get inside my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell you anything that\Nyou could use against my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio, I don't understand\Nwhy you're so loyal to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.01,0:14:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you honestly telling\Nme that you'd die for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.67,0:14:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.19,0:14:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear of death holds no place in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.51,0:14:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of the power of my stand,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been able to\Nlive a life unencumbered
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.63,0:14:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by such inconsequential fears like death.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could always win any fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:15:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could have and do whatever I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing and stealing were\Nabsolutely meaningless to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should talk to the Moth about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he knows how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.63,0:15:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio was the first person\Nwho was able to look
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,deep within my soul and\Nfind something more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one who gave\Nme a desire to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That glorious force of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was so strong, so wise, so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.05,0:15:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the one and only person in my life\Nto ever see a purpose for my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited such a long time for\Nan opportunity to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will gladly die for my master's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but no matter what, I refuse to do\Nanything that would disappoint him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.17,0:15:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And after all, evil or not, a scoundrel\Nneeds someone to put his faith in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you this before I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know that my name is N'Dur,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.61,0:16:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and my stand hails from Egypt,\Nthe birthplace of the Tarot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's referred to as one of the Nine\NGods of Egypt, Geb of the Great Ennead.
