Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nine Egyptian gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.07,0:16:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:25.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'll only\Ntell you about my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only fair since you're the\None who ended up stopping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.09,0:16:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But info on my compatriots\Ngoes with me to my grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.45,0:17:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you brainwash this\Npeople like a cult leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.67,0:17:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just who is this guy exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's this crap about\Nthe nine gods of Egypt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.57,0:17:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now, we just have\Nto keep moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you don't have to be defensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.31,0:17:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm angry\Nwith you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes sense to be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt you want her\Nto be dragged out into
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the desert and forced\Ninto some human crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.71,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your position must suck ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can blame you for being upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.31,0:17:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iggy, here, you want some gum?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.93,0:17:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you calm down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.95,0:17:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief, that dog is a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:18:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can stay out here in\Nthe desert for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.99,0:18:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, well, what do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You went back and fetched my hat for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.03,0:18:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
