Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.77,0:18:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.21,0:18:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.77,0:18:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.33,0:19:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.77,0:20:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet! Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.55,0:20:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a comic book\Nyou're reading, little man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Egyptians read comics just like the\Nrest of us you want so many doughnuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.81,0:20:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, mind if I see your comic book?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.67,0:20:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you let me, I promise I'll\Nbe super careful with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a comic book artist who's\Nsearching for inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets me jazzed up more than\Nchecking out rare books and comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me borrow it and you\Ncan use my binoculars
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell peculiar the stories\Nabout these two eerie looking brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.65,0:20:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see the creator's name
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.89,0:21:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these are all such bizarre drawings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is fantastic print quality,\Nnot to mention it's in full color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There once lived two brothers\Nwho got along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Zenyatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.93,0:21:15.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.23,0:21:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta, the younger brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.73,0:21:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was very shy and wouldn't do anything\Nunless Zenyatta was with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.69,0:21:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One day, while his big brother\NZenyatta was away, Monday,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.49,0:21:27.53,SFXComic - Copy,4.1,0,0,0,,{=27}{\blur1.1\bord2\fscx80\fscy100\fs200\frz354.1\pos(165.05,79.33)\c&H172527&}Smile
