Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta had more fun than\Nhe'd had in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's 10.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, the very kind traveler
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.45,0:21:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was impaled on a telephone\Npole and died a horrific death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.21,0:21:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a weird comic you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this comic especially\Npopular in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, it's really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.37,0:21:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other pages are all blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.93,0:22:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they forgot to print the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow, I feel as though\NI have a connection to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.17,0:22:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's totally pulled me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.99,0:22:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna sound crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but would it be possible for\Nme to buy this book from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.73,0:22:12.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.99,0:22:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bro's book's not for sale.
