Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what have I told you\Nabout talking to strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.03,0:22:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's lots of bad people roaming\Nthe world these days, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.47,0:22:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last call!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bus for Aswan is\Ngetting ready to depart!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.19,0:22:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.49,0:22:41.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on their way to\Nthe hospital in Aswan to
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.87,0:22:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,drop off their friend and\Nhave his injuries treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.67,0:22:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how it is, we'll just\Nhave to wait for the next bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.21,0:23:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
