Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and I are invincible together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.69,0:23:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is in our car?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.02,0:23:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.94,0:23:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, where's your school uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting really weird today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.77,0:23:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you're clasping your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that would mean no.
